Package: hifiberry-pipewire-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         hifiberry-pipewire (>= 1.4.5)
Description: HiFiBerry-specific configuration files for PipeWire
 This package provides optional HiFiBerry-specific configuration files for
 WirePlumber, including:
 .
  - Stereo balance filter for audio channel balance adjustment
 .
 These configurations enhance the base PipeWire installation with additional
 HiFiBerry-specific audio processing capabilities. The base ALSA configuration,
 WirePlumber system service, and headless system configuration are provided
 by the main hifiberry-pipewire package.
